<li>&lt;a href="Stasion%20Semarang%20Tawang"&gt;Stasion Semarang Tawang&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Stasion%20Surabaya%20Pasarturi"&gt;Stasion Surabaya Pasarturi&lt;/a&gt;</li>
