Adam Richard Sandler (leuwih dipikawanoh: Adam Sandler; gumelar di &lt;a href="Brooklyn"&gt;Brooklyn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sarikat"&gt;Amérika Sarikat&lt;/a&gt;, 9 1966; umur 60 taun) nyaéta saurang &lt;a href="aktor"&gt;aktor&lt;/a&gt;, komédian, panulis naskah, produser pilem, sarta musisi asal &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sarikat"&gt;Amérika Sarikat&lt;/a&gt;. Adam ngamimitian karirna dina taun &lt;a href="1989"&gt;1989&lt;/a&gt;. Sanggeus midang dina &lt;a href="pilem"&gt;pilem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Saturday%20Night%20Live"&gt;Saturday Night Live&lt;/a&gt; minangka peran pangrojong, Sandler tuluy ngabéntangan sawatara pilem favorit Hollywood sangkan total panghasilanna nepi kana 2 miliar &lt;a href="USD"&gt;USD&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="box%20office"&gt;box office&lt;/a&gt;. Peranna dina pilem komédi &lt;a href="Going%20Overboard"&gt;Going Overboard&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1989"&gt;1989&lt;/a&gt;) ogé dianggap minangka jalan kasuksésanna, tuluy nyusul tawara sajumlahing &lt;a href="pilem"&gt;pilem&lt;/a&gt; anu kudu dibéntanganna. Adam suksés deui dina ngabéntangan &lt;a href="Billy%20Madison"&gt;Billy Madison&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1995"&gt;1995&lt;/a&gt;), tuluy &lt;a href="pilem"&gt;pilem-pilem&lt;/a&gt; suksés lianna kayaning, &lt;a href="Happy%20Gilmore"&gt;Happy Gilmore&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1996"&gt;1996&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="The%20Wedding%20Singer"&gt;The Wedding Singer&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1998"&gt;1998&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="The%20Waterboy"&gt;The Waterboy&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1998"&gt;1998&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Anger%20Management"&gt;Anger Management&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="50%20First%20Dates"&gt;50 First Dates&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Spanglish"&gt;Spanglish&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;) jeung &lt;a href="Click"&gt;Click&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;). Liwat peranna minangka Michael Newman dina &lt;a href="pilem"&gt;pilem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Click"&gt;Click&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;), Adam asup nominasi pikeun pameran komédi panghadéna &lt;a href="Oscar"&gt;Oscar&lt;/a&gt;. Sedengkeun liwat &lt;a href="Punch-Drunk%20Love"&gt;Punch-Drunk Love&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;), Adam suksés ngaraih Golden Globe Awards pikeun kategori Best Aktor Comedy.
